{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42912","headline":"赠别营妓卿卿 · 油蔚","name":"赠别营妓卿卿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"怜君无那是多情，枕上相看直到明。\n日照绿窗人去住，鸦啼红粉泪纵横。\n愁肠只向金闺断，白发应从玉塞生。\n爲报花时少惆怅，此生终不负卿卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"油蔚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42912.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42912","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《才调集》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/才調集_(四庫全書本)）"}